This product includes software developed by the ignitify integrations authors.

integrations/stream serves hls.js (https://github.com/video-dev/hls.js), Apache-2.0, from its npm package at run time.
integrations/stream drives ffmpeg (https://ffmpeg.org) as a separate process. ffmpeg is not distributed by this project;
it is installed in the task image as a system package and keeps its own licence (LGPL-2.1-or-later, or GPL when
built with GPL components).
